      "**March 31, 2023:** [A short story from Mu Yao](https://domijin.medium.com/a-short-story-from-mu-yao-4c564fa51d21) — this is a medium post about a short story by the author Mu Yao  — you will see my interests in #technology and #humanities with #optimistism. -",
      "**March 31, 2023:** [Boeing’s Future at Stake: The Growing Challenge from SpaceX](https://domijin.medium.com/boeings-future-at-stake-the-growing-challenge-from-spacex-177b63b10882) — this is my medium post commenting about Boeing and SpaceX’s competition in aerospace, demonstrating my business sense with first principle thinking as well as my exposure in this space driven by curiosity & unique background. -",
