      "**October 10, 2023:** [Observation: the dilemma and cultural difference behind the eVTOL field](https://domijin.medium.com/observation-the-dilemma-and-cultural-difference-behind-the-evtol-field-df42e91af109) — this is my medium post commenting about the dilemma and cultural difference in regulation and commercial attempt to be the “first-mover advantage” in the eVTOL field — unreveiling the potential envy beyond the denial, anger and ignorance reaction. -",
